{"id":"664072","name":"蒸香菜","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/664072/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"普通面粉","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"自家种的香菜。","img":"images/664072/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"择好的香菜，洗净，沥干水分。","img":"images/664072/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切寸段，备用。","img":"images/664072/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"先放入少许油，拌匀，再撒上少许面粉，均匀的裹上干面。","img":"images/664072/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"水开后放入蒸笼里，大火上笼蒸五分钟。","img":"images/664072/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒸好后立即放入盆里，用筷子快速拌匀，使其散热。","img":"images/664072/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蒜切碎，加少许盐捣成蒜泥，备用。","img":"images/664072/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入蒜泥，滴几滴香油。","img":"images/664072/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/664072/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/664072/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"口感鲜嫩干爽。","img":"images/664072/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}